RTED BY INTUITIVE SOFTWARE AND DESIGN TOOLS, THE MSPM0 MCU PORTFOLIO ALLOWS DESIGNERS TO SPEND MORE TIME INNOVATING AND LESS TIME EVALUATING AND CODING – CUTTING DESIGN TIME FROM MONTHS TO DAYS.'}